er_ids from the start response, and never use another identity's flags, tokens, or artifacts. For timed modes, start reconnects to the same attempt; only retry spends one of the unique_attempts_remaining. After all fresh variants are used, practice continues on the last artifact without a timer or Hall of Fame time and can still complete the mode. V\n...\n</persisted-output>","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01D5fvyzqtnx6EA57P5CBGwm","agent_id":"a2acad75aff1f1411","session_id":"1b2a5880-b146-4584-b0b5-a8899fa1bffe","uuid":"dca110d2-cb39-4dd3-9c42-728326661312","timestamp":"2026-10-09T13:03:23.018Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01H4QPvkZK2SoPwdFgAid8Me","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"scripting day09 technique log"}
