.py\\npyplan.py\\nsolve.py\\nvbsplan.py\\nEvery stager claims to know who came before it and who comes next. Build the relationship graph from final-byte evidence alone, and expose the stage whose claimed family tree is impossible.\\n71:- `nodejs-chain (node-staged-chain.mjs)` | role, attack, adapter, campaign, service-name, stage-count, steps | 7 open | enum/exact_text/integer/mitre_attack_id/ordered_tokens | Classify node-staged-chain.mjs as benign_utility, stager, dropper, downloader, uploader, launcher, persistence\\n72:- `polyglot-php-benign-utility (polyglot-php-benign-utility.php)` | role, attack, adapter, campaign, file-path, stage-count, steps, host-profile, obfuscation, stage-profile, next-language | 11 open | enum/exact_text/integer/mitre_attack_id/ordered_tokens | Classify the inert source role.\\n73:- `polyglot-php-stager (polyglot-php-stager.php)` | role, attack, adapter, campaign, url, stage-count, steps, host-profile, obfuscation, stage-profile, next-language | 11 open | enum/exact_text/integer/mitre_attack_id/ordered_tokens | Classify the inert source role.\\n74:- `polyglot-php-dropper (polyglot-php-dropper.php)` | role, attack, adapter, campaign, url, stage-count, steps, host-profile, obfuscation, stage-profile, next-language | 11 open | enum/exact_text/intege\n{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":50,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":50,\"session_id\":\"a26483f7-f52d-446a-a89b-cfe58aac473c\",\"uuid\":\"995bec73-5a33-4205-90f1-383a12152ac4\"}\n{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":229,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":179,\"session_id\":\"a26483f7-f52d-446a-a89b-cfe58aac473c\",\"uuid\":\"016db8ca-90f2-4f3d-89d1-29cde6967650\"}\n{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cfrhs285KaeQtUThJkfXL\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"\",\"signature\":\"\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"