rcase hex>` confirmed","-  again on d8 (7/7 variants). The GM accepts the decoded","+- No mobile answer has ever been rejected (zero wrong submissions on days 1-9). `ANS-<16 uppercase hex>` confirmed","+  again on d8 and d9 (7/7 variants each). The GM accepts the decoded","   `huntress_puzzle.json` value as the \"backend evidence code\" even though the prompt says \"invoke ... return the backend","   evidence code\"."," - Mastery feedback is per set: `{\"result\":\"accepted\",\"remaining\":N}` after each set, then `CORRECT` on the last. An"]},{"oldStart":140,"oldLines":12,"newStart":156,"newLines":13,"lines":["   JSON-escaped as `\\u003c`/`\\u003e`, so json-load it, never regex the raw text). Keep only the candidate that","   fullmatches `^ANS-[0-9A-F]{16}$`."," - **Mastery filenames** carry a literal `delivery N: ` prefix. A naive path lookup fails.","-- **6-10s timed windows** (day 2+; d7 TT 9s/Mastery 10s, d8 both 8s) are dominated by start + download + submit. Solve time is about 0.1s, so do no","+- **6-11s timed windows** (day 2+; d7 TT 9s/Mastery 10s, d8 both 8s, d9 TT 8s/Mastery 11s) are dominated by start + download + submit. Solve time is about 0.1s, so do no","   decompiling in-window: read the zip entry directly. Day 2 Mastery expired 8 times before Homebase routing.","-- **Don't decompile when you don't need to.** Every solve so far (d1-d8) needed only the asset; the manifest was context only.","+- **Don't decompile when you don't need to.** Every solve so far (d1-d9) needed only the asset; the manifest was context only.","   Keep jadx/apktool for the day the asset is missing or lacks `ANS-`.","-- **Prompt wording escalates, the artifact did not** (d7 \"cross a bridge\", d8 \"replay the session against the backend\"):","-  judge by what the APK contains (pcap/HAR, token file, network_security_config, native lib), not by the verb.","+- **Prompt wording escalates, the artifact did not** (d7 \"cross a bridge\", d8 \"replay the session against the backend\",