{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01An9Mpht9UpawisNdvmddJs","type":"tool_result","content":"- Mastery is cumulative. Day N mastery = 5N-2 sets (3, 8, 13, ..., 38, 43). Each set blob has N numbered lines `NN<TAB>fragment`, and line k uses day k's encoding (b64, rot13, hex, binary, decimal, octal, url-%XX, html-entity, `\"<BS>uXXXX\"`, in that order so far). The last line has no trailing newline. The fragments join verbatim (split mid-word) into the same sentence.\n  Day 9 backslash escapes: every char as lowercase `<BS>u00XX`, the fragment WRAPPED IN DOUBLE QUOTES (a JSON string\n  literal) in all 45 blobs (single, TT, 43 mastery lines); no `<BS>x`, `<BS>n`, `<BS>\"`, uppercase hex or non-ASCII seen. Rule: if\n  the fragment matches `^\"?(?:<BS><BS>(?:u[0-9a-fA-F]{4}|x[0-9a-fA-F]{2}|[nrt\"<BS><BS>/]))+\"?$`, decode with `json.loads` (add the quotes if missing) -- that also covers\n  `<BS>n`, `<BS>\"`, surrogate pairs and non-ASCII; fall back to `codecs.decode(t,'unicode_escape')` for `<BS>xNN`. Drop the quotes.\n- **Line wrapper** -- `NN<TAB>fragment` numbering; fragments split mid-word and join verbatim in number order.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016qGSngjh22hfzcG5yNyPyv","agent_id":"aed02cd9fb3b16140","session_id":"1b2a5880-b146-4584-b0b5-a8899fa1bffe","uuid":"721680cc-05b2-4ca6-9e09-6b9c750215ca","timestamp":"2026-10-09T13:04:59.222Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01An9Mpht9UpawisNdvmddJs","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"warmups day09 technique log"}
