so set the offset on the raw and hex paths, which the solver leaves out.\n\nNo new `lib/elf.py` branch was needed; `fields()` already covers the integer machine answer (`62`).","usage":{"total_tokens":121902,"tool_uses":35,"duration_ms":265407},"uuid":"fc2732ba-400b-4045-b372-2b5e06c50440","session_id":"1b2a5880-b146-4584-b0b5-a8899fa1bffe"}
